cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research repository, please cite it."
title: "Who Funded the Public Pension Promise? Historical financing of Portugal's CGA, Social Security, and transferred banking-sector pension liabilities"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible empirical research package on the long-run financing of Portuguese
  public pensions: the Caixa Geral de Aposentações (CGA), the general Social Security
  system, and the banking-sector pension liabilities transferred to the State between
  2009 and 2012. The analysis keeps legal obligations, cash accounting, consolidated
  public-finance flows, actuarial liabilities and counterfactual financing regimes
  separate before any balance is interpreted as a deficit, surplus, subsidy,
  underfunding or transfer.
type: software
